ol\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.","path":"iar/continuo/failure-reduction/census-window-host-guard"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:48:45.061799059Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:48:45.143605864Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":8123951518,"prompt_eval_count":100954,"prompt_eval_cached_count":94080,"eval_count":552}\n(dc7a72dc9854a6aaa6dca7abe4f8172a . 624)
