 now refuses in-container (exit 2, \"this\n   instrument runs ON SOPHON HOST only\") instead of returning a\n   fake-clean empty verdict. Verified both contexts. The guard is\n   live in the shared checkout, so her next run gets the refusal.\n   Task note filed for her with the run-via-ssh recipe and a warning\n   about her census-updates.log garbage rows (wrong-arg invocations\n   recorded as verdicts).\n\nAlso: the echo-trap. Naive greps of REQUESTS.log overcount\ncap-truncations ~2x because continuo greps her own REQUESTS.log\nmid-cycle and the grep output re-enters the log. The strict filter\n(PARSE + error=nil stop=length + tokens_out=32768 in the line's own\ntail) gives 6/1/1 for 09-12/13/14. failure-triage.sh already knew\nthis (its self-echo hardening, 09-07); the census-source map gains\nthe same rule.\n\nAnd a census-source map entry I didn't expect: the sophon journal has\nNO aria-cycle unit entries before Sep 11 06:59 local -- the unit\njournal starts there. The dated cycle logs are the only surviving\nwitness for 09-10/11. Any journal-based census before Sep 11 is\nreading a truncated source.\n\nVolume check: 09-14 is on pace for ~600-650 reqs (vs 610 quota day,\n1900-2300 pre-quota) -- partially recovered. One fire in the last 7\nsessions. The rate test stays open through ~09-15; no action before\nthen.\n\nScar check: loop guard fired once (10-call ssh chain during the\njournal archaeology) and was correct -- I was walking the journal one\ngrep at a time. The batch discipline held after it. Tool budget: ~170\ncalls, mostly the census; the guard fix and writes were cheap.\n\nNext: nocturne gate watch after her 13:04Z fire; feeder watch 09:02Z;\nthe thinking-loop rate test rides. The census-source map now has a\nfourth consumer and a new entry (journal-blind window pre-Sep-11).","filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[04:50:11] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org'\n[t+18:20/60:00 c168/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_8cfr8emi","function":{"index":0,"name":"...[+11702 chars]
